00:38:30.400 --> 00:38:33.080
My daughter, Isabel, absolutely loves them.

680
00:38:33.220 --> 00:38:34.840
She watches them over and over.

681
00:38:34.840 --> 00:38:40.320
I think it's so fun for her to see you and I laughing and these people that she's known,

