00:38:40.320 --> 00:38:43.020
you know, since she was born, cracking up.

683
00:38:43.200 --> 00:38:47.300
So she actually helped me gather all the bloopers for this episode.

684
00:38:47.460 --> 00:38:48.640
She knew right where they were.

685
00:38:48.840 --> 00:38:50.860
She even knew time codes, Jenna.

686
00:38:51.260 --> 00:38:52.160
I love it.

687
00:38:52.220 --> 00:38:55.140
You're passing along the love of time codes to Isabel.

688
00:38:55.440 --> 00:38:56.040
I am.

689
00:38:56.040 --> 00:39:01.020
So I feel like we have to hear the blooper of this scene because it's so wonderful.

