00:40:01.900 --> 00:40:11.540
The whole thing was, you've gone to someone's house when they've just gotten their new TV system with their new sound speakers, and they're so excited to show it off.

707
00:40:11.640 --> 00:40:15.100
Maybe they even, like, play part of a movie for you, right?

708
00:40:15.360 --> 00:40:15.720
Yes.

709
00:40:15.880 --> 00:40:17.600
That was the inspiration for this.

710
00:40:17.720 --> 00:40:23.560
And so Steve was going to bring that energy of, like, we were sitting in a professionally done.

