00:40:24.620 --> 00:40:26.000
Home theater, right?

712
00:40:26.640 --> 00:40:27.040
Yes.

713
00:40:27.520 --> 00:40:32.620
But instead, he's just talking about this tiny TV, which, by the way, is not even a plasma TV.

714
00:40:32.820 --> 00:40:36.420
It's just a flat screen TV, but it keeps referring to it as a plasma TV.

715
00:40:36.860 --> 00:40:37.840
Oh, my God.

716
00:40:38.380 --> 00:40:39.700
Jenna, do you know what I love?

717
00:40:39.820 --> 00:40:43.100
Is that how this is still a joke with the caSt.

718
00:40:43.360 --> 00:40:46.020
So a few years ago, you guys, we've talked about this before.

719
00:40:46.180 --> 00:40:52.160
We have a cast text thread where we will text and check in, say hello, little clips, pictures of our kids.

720
00:40:52.160 --> 00:40:59.100
And Creed usually sings us a song at Christmas, and he'll text us, you know, him at home with his, like, elf hat on.

721
00:40:59.820 --> 00:41:02.520
And Jenna sent a photo to all of us.

722
00:41:02.600 --> 00:41:11.000
